          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said, “Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you have completely deceived the people of Jerusalem! You have said there would be peace, but a sword is at their throats.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The time is coming when the people of Jerusalem will be told that a scorching wind is blowing in from the desert towards them. It will not be a gentle wind that only blows away the chaff — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the wind that comes at the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s command will be much stronger than that! It is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " himself who is pronouncing judgement on his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look, the enemy is coming like clouds. Their war chariots are like a whirlwind, and their horses are faster than eagles. We are lost! We are doomed!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem, wash the evil from your heart, so that you may be saved. How long will you go on thinking sinful thoughts?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Messengers from the city of Dan and from the hills of Ephraim announce the bad news. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have come to warn the nations and to tell Jerusalem that enemies are coming from a country far away. These enemies will shout against the cities of Judah ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and will surround Jerusalem like men guarding a field, because her people have rebelled against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
